(7704646, 1264351, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely image.  Coming back around on a few challenges and noticed I gave this an 8 and didn''t call it out in the ''Top Challenge picks that failed to make the Top 10'' thread (little late for that now - sorry).<br/> <br/>While I really do like this image as is, have you considered how it presents with a strong crop removing most of the lower water reflection?  I get the desire to have that sun reflection ... it just looks like a strong image without the extra space.  Thinking out loud here.  :-)</td>', 'This is a lovely image.  Coming back around on a few challenges and noticed I gave this an 8 and didn''t call it out in the ''Top Challenge picks that failed to make the Top 10'' thread (little late for that now - sorry). While I really do like this image as is, have you considered how it presents with a strong crop removing most of the lower water reflection?  I get the desire to have that sun reflection ... it just looks like a strong image without the extra space.  Thinking out loud here.  :-)', '2021-10-26 07:57:23.000000', NULL, 0);
